## Cloud Deployment (Railway + Vercel)

After pushing to GitHub (see Step 1.C):

```sh
railway login && nox -s deploy   # API + DB
vercel --prod                    # Frontend
```

Set every required variable from [Environment Variables](#environment-variables) in
both the Railway and Vercel project settings before deploying.

{% elif runtime.infra.api == 'railway' %}

## Cloud Deployment (Railway)

